{"schemaVersion":"decision-record.v1","decisionId":"decision-question-ending-direction-1-answer-1785940421764","questionId":"question-ending-direction","projectSlug":"novel-1780911338197","questionVersion":1,"answerText":"在异界点尸成兵，将臣修炼到极致的境界，然后主角道法和魔法双休，《道家宝典》乃是上古奇书，师傅在跟将臣决战的时候将储物袋赠与主角，里面就有这本书，还有三尺青峰桃木剑，一个酒葫芦（师傅爱喝酒），然后《道家宝典》主要就是可以点尸成兵，摇铃控尸，还兼顾修体，算命，拘魂，雷法等各大体系的法门。","answerStatus":"confirmed","status":"recorded","sourceFingerprint":"ae98ded965a6fb3a6a821cc07346d8682eb985c40bd6cd7e3741f0c9e7b708d0","evidenceRefs":[{"kind":"dialogue-question","refId":"question-ending-direction"}],"answerPayload":{"schemaVersion":"dialogue-answer-payload.v1","answerId":"answer-question-ending-direction-1-answer-1785940421764","questionId":"question-ending-direction","questionVersion":1,"answerText":"在异界点尸成兵，将臣修炼到极致的境界，然后主角道法和魔法双休，《道家宝典》乃是上古奇书，师傅在跟将臣决战的时候将储物袋赠与主角，里面就有这本书，还有三尺青峰桃木剑，一个酒葫芦（师傅爱喝酒），然后《道家宝典》主要就是可以点尸成兵，摇铃控尸，还兼顾修体，算命，拘魂，雷法等各大体系的法门。","answerStatus":"confirmed","sourceFingerprint":"ae98ded965a6fb3a6a821cc07346d8682eb985c40bd6cd7e3741f0c9e7b708d0","evidenceRefs":["question-ending-direction"],"submittedAt":"2026-08-05T14:33:42.072Z","fingerprint":"f5e62c32a2b8daed103140f7d1ebbd4def636b793bdd7f09706c8004f5459acf"},"canonWritten":false,"createdAt":"2026-08-05T14:33:42.072Z","fingerprint":"5426426fa76e8c6a9d6676a0dde8f0234260f3df4a1a28914a45d099d03c0fde"}
